  "review": {
    "gallery": "Nine distinct Danube project-page renders from Serenz. The lobby, living room and leisure scenes were checked against the branded brochure. Other Danube developments pictured on the location map are not gallery images.",
    "location": "Developer neighbourhood map on physical page 4 and 14 printed travel estimates from physical page 5. The Madena project point is on the JVC side of Al Khail Road, consistent with the brochure. Use it as a vicinity point.",
    "floorPlans": "51 complete sheets from the Danube combined apartment and retail book: 30 apartments, 15 retail drawings and six plates. Complete printed numerical panels were verified. Separate editions repeat the same drawing families. Retained the more legible podium amenities sheet on page 38."
  },
